      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "훈련장에 도착하자 한 여기사가 나를 기다리고 있었다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "訓練場に到着すると、1人の女騎士が待っていた。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 3,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "왠지 모르게 뻣뻣한 느낌에, 표정도 경직되어 있는 것 같은데…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "心なしか態度もぎこちなく、表情もこわばっているように見えるんだが…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 4,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "여, 여어-!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "よ、よおー！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 5,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "CameraOffset": "ONE_3",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "FA",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "반갑소이다, 여정 단장!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "逢えて嬉しいでござるよ、旅の団長よ！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 6,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "바… 반갑소이다?",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "ご…ござる？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 7,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "나는 모나스티르 공국의 기사단장…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "吾輩はモナスティル公国の騎士団長…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 8,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "샤를이라고 하는데요!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "シャルルといいます！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 9,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "하는데요?",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "いいます？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 10,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "UnitMotion": "SERIOUS",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "아, 아니 아니! 샤를이라 하오!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "い、いやいや！シャルルと申す！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 11,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_01",
      "WaitClick": false,
      "WaitTime": 1.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그대가 내 여정 단장이신가?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "其方が旅の団長でおいでで？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 12,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_01",
      "WaitClick": false,
      "WaitTime": 2.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "CameraOffset": "TWIN_6",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "NR",
      "UnitMotion": "SURPRISE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "…요?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "…すか？",
      "TalkTime": 0.15
    },
    {
      "Uid": 13,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 2.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "EmotionEffect": "THINK",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "…",
      "TalkTime": 0.2
    },
    {
      "Uid": 14,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "UnitMotion": "SPECIAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "아아아-! 요를 빼고 말해야 한다니까!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "あああー！「すか」を言わないでと！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 15,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "어젯밤 몇 번이나 연습했잖아…! 왜 자꾸 요를 붙이는 거야-!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "夜遅くまで何度も練習したのに…！あたしのばかー！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 16,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "UnitMotion": "SERIOUS",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "애초에 존댓말을 쓸 걸 그랬나? 아니, 좀 더 권위 있는 말투를 쓰는 게 맞았을까?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "普通の敬語を使うべきだったかな？いや、もっと偉そうな方が良かったかな？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 17,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "너무 딱딱한 표현이었나? 그대...? 당신…? 자네? 너? 너님?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "少しかしこまりすぎたかな？貴殿…？貴君…？貴様？お前？お前さん？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 18,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "UnitMotion": "SPECIAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "우우… 우우우-!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "うぅ…うううー！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 19,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "UnitMotion": "SAD",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "죄송합니다! 모나스티르 기사단장으로서 멋진 첫 모습을 보여드리고 싶었는데…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "すみません！モナスティルの騎士団長として好印象を与えようと思いましたのに…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 20,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_KINGDOM_KNIGHT",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "이번에도 멋진 기사단장처럼 말하는 건…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "今回も、気高い騎士団長っぽく話すのは―",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 21,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_KINGDOM_KNIGHT_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "BgFlashBang": 0.2,
      "BgCrash": 0.8,
      "BgCrashTime": 0.5,
      "StartFxSoundName": "SFX_BATTLE_COMMON_POP.wav",
